  "description_short": "George's go-to spot for artisan breakfast, quality coffee, and fresh bakery treats in a relaxed café setting.",
  "description_long": "Tucked along Park Street in the heart of George, Krust Café has built a loyal following for its commitment to quality ingredients and proper coffee. The café atmosphere strikes that perfect balance between buzzing and comfortable – ideal whether you're meeting a friend or settling in with your laptop.\n\nThe menu leans heavily on breakfast done right, from fluffy scrambled eggs to stacked pancakes, alongside freshly baked pastries that emerge from the kitchen throughout the day. Their coffee is consistently good, and the kitchen doesn't cut corners on produce. Lunch options keep things simple with sandwiches, salads, and daily specials that change with what's available.\n\nConveniently located in central George, it's an easy stop whether you're a local regular or passing through the Garden Route. The vibe is unpretentious and welcoming, with staff who know their menu and genuinely seem to enjoy being there.",
